[[StarWhales]]
StarWhales are giant whales the sizes of blimps super fat they float ever gently above in the sky making beautiful sounds, they bring a sense of awe and peace to the town, always friendly.
Not much is known about them, because no-one from the town really wants to do anything to disturb them. However that doesn't mean that other places in the world haven't researched them.

